  "text": "Here is the global calendar integration that seamlessly respects all international employee holidays. Distributed companies with staff across Europe, Asia, and Latin America struggle with overlapping national observances. Blind scheduling causes awkward meeting invites during local celebrations, damaging team morale and cross-cultural alignment. Deploying PTO Ninja with Slack integrations broadcasts upcoming country holidays three days early to prevent scheduling clashes. Your company culture thrives while project deadlines stay intact.",
